# W30c, host a (k10): its own Dry Land instance (New instance next to c's at stag0201), then on to stag0202 (Grief
# Wasteland), where it stays: its row is one with nobody at stag0201. (stag0202 instead of the design's dng205b1: a k10
# character in dng205b1 died within 60 s in round I1a's runs; W30 stays in stag0202 as well.)
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log a hosts Dry Land
explore matz00 yes until stage=stag0202,control
log a in stag0202
idle until epoch>=@460
log a done
